%% Phase4 / search / MV3-G14a 全局搜索（会话 / 联系人 / 消息三段）
%% 机器真源: cses-client phase4.manifest.json；Helix search.rs/helpers.rs；Java search gateway；Angular dialog-search
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as DialogSearchComponent
  participant P as MessageV3ImGate
  participant T as Tauri search commands
  participant H as Helix Tick / search outbound
  participant J as Java search gateway
  participant B as EventSink im:__bus__
  participant S as Angular search signal
  UI->>P: searchGlobal(keyword,limit)
  par 会话
    P->>T: im_search_channel
  and 联系人
    P->>T: im_search_user
  and 消息
    P->>T: im_search_do
  end
  T->>H: Tick::Command(req_id, keyword, limit)
  H->>J: Effect::Http POST /search/channel, /search/user, /search/do
  J-->>H: HTTP body result
  Note over H,J: HTTP 2xx 只完成 transport；解析成功并与 req_id 对账后才产生查询结果
  H->>H: Tick::PortReply(Http Ok) / validate DTO
  H->>B: Effect::Emit im:read:result(req_id,data)
  B->>S: Helix read waiter resolve
  S->>UI: channels / users / posts 三段渲染
  Note over H,B: 只读搜索无 PersistAtomic、无 SQLite 写投影、无 WS 权威回声；不得虚构 fallback
